  "summary": {
    "en": "In the past 8 hours the ecosystem added 47 new plugins and 743 net official stars, alongside the dsh 0.1.6-alpha.2 release; growth was led by dsh-desktop (+154 stars) and awesome-dsh-plugin (+74 stars), while 11,817 of 15,317 non-fork plugins have been stale for 7+ days and the health score sits at 38.",
    "zh": "过去 8 小时生态新增 <b>47</b> 个插件，官方仓库星标净增 <b>743</b>，并发布了 dsh <b>0.1.6-alpha.2</b>；增长主要由 dsh-desktop（+<b>154</b> 星）和 awesome-dsh-plugin（+<b>74</b> 星）带动，但 <b>15317</b> 个非 fork 插件中仍有 <b>11817</b> 个 7 天未更新，健康分仅 <b>38</b>，建议持续观察存量维护情况。"
